{"parentUuid":"07d8c4f3-cf20-4c2b-bb82-761670b3f647","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"msg_b78d9afbd2cd457cb11685d7","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking whether Ethernet is only used for communication between computers. This is a good question - Ethernet is used for much more than just computers. Let me explain in simple terms, keeping the non-technical audience in mind.","signature":""}],"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0}},"type":"assistant","uuid":"155e62cb-80d5-4c06-8f50-772e6d01bacc","timestamp":"2026-07-04T02:23:50.608Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\project\\easyTalk\\网络知识","sessionId":"21ff3827-8b2e-434a-b620-a49c88bce92c","version":"2.1.160","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
{"parentUuid":"155e62cb-80d5-4c06-8f50-772e6d01bacc","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"msg_b78d9afbd2cd457cb11685d7","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## 不只是电脑，所有能联网的设备都可以\n\n用以太网传数据的设备远不止电脑，举一些你身边的例子：\n\n- **手机**连 WiFi 虽然看着没有线，但 WiFi 路由器背后插着网线，走的还是以太网\n- **电视机、机顶盒**——看网络电视、投屏\n- **摄像头**——监控录像通过网线传回录像机\n- **打印机**——办公室共享的网络打印机\n- **游戏机**——PS5、Switch 插网线联网\n\n甚至很多你想不到的东西：\n\n- 工厂里的**机器臂、传感器**\n- 超市里的**收银机、扫码枪**\n- 医院里的**各种检测仪器**\n\n**只要这个设备需要联网、传数据，而且用的是那套规矩，它就是\"以太网设备\"。**\n\n---\n\n### 一句话说\n\n> 以太网不挑设备，**谁遵守这套规矩，谁就能加入进来通信**。电脑只是其中最常见的一种。\n\n以太网之所以这么普及，就是因为这套规矩简单、便宜、好用，所以大家全用它。"}],"usage":{"input_tokens":676,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":24576,"output_tokens":297,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"de66faae-31b2-441f-8759-d465d53d8115","timestamp":"2026-07-04T02:23:55.629Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\project\\easyTalk\\网络知识","sessionId":"21ff3827-8b2e-434a-b620-a49c88bce92c","version":"2.1.160","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
