{"parentUuid":"0d14e078-9652-4e6f-91fd-0f672c644820","isSidechain":false,"type":"system","subtype":"away_summary","content":"我们正在用大白话帮你理解网络基础知识，从二层技术、以太网、MAC地址、交换机工作原理讲到了以太网帧的结构。你刚纠正了我一点：数据传输不是套娃，而是在前面不断贴标签、收到后从头逐段撕掉。有新问题可以继续问。 (disable recaps in /config)","timestamp":"2026-07-04T02:53:46.871Z","uuid":"b52446bc-b3a0-44a4-aa2f-9b278480ba54","isMeta":false,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\project\\easyTalk\\网络知识","sessionId":"21ff3827-8b2e-434a-b620-a49c88bce92c","version":"2.1.160","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
